# assistente utile U4 (docs/plans/assistente-utile.md) — chi chiede come fare
# LUI qualcosa chiede i passi: la procedura in KB si raggiunge anche con «how do
# i» / «how can i», e senza passi il muro e' quello del procedimento, non un
# programma mancante ne' un saggio di metodo.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test how do i reaches a procedure without a making verb]
!timeout 30
> How do I change a flat tire?
<~ 1. Park safely on level ground

[test how can i make is a procedure, not a program]
!timeout 30
> How can I make tea?
<~ 1. Fill a kettle
<! no code to show

[test with a programming language it is still code]
!timeout 30
> How do I reverse a list in Python?
<~ in python

[test without steps the honest procedure wall, not a method essay]
!timeout 30
> How do I make my laptop battery last longer?
<~ I don't have the steps for it yet
<! turns on
